  <questiondescription format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p id="concept">Navigation: places a given distance apart</p><p id="description">Grade 12 CBE Core 2.7 (c) / Essential 2.3 (d): Give latitudes of two places on a meridian that are a given number of nautical miles apart, on opposite sides of the equator and on the same side.</p><p id="edition">Core and Essential</p><p id="provenance">This question is original to this project.</p><p id="citation">INNODEMS CBC Grade 12 Mathematics, first draft by Ben Davies, 2026. Aligned to the KICD Senior School Curriculum Design, Core and Essential Mathematics Grade 12 (draft).</p>]]></text></questiondescription>
