    <node><name>1</name><description>Range</description><answertest>AlgEquiv</answertest><sans>g1</sans><tans>true</tans><testoptions></testoptions><quiet>0</quiet><truescoremode>=</truescoremode><truescore>0.0000000</truescore><truepenalty></truepenalty><truenextnode>-1</truenextnode><trueanswernote>prt1-2-T</trueanswernote><truefeedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>Latitudes are between \(0^\circ\) and \(90^\circ\), and neither \(P\) nor \(Q\) is on the equator, so both must be more than \(0^\circ\) and at most \(90^\circ\).</p>[[if test="u1"]]<p>\({@D1@}\) nm is \({@D1@}\) minutes of arc, which is \({@k1@}^\circ\), not \({@D1@}^\circ\).</p>[[/if]]]]></text></truefeedback><falsescoremode>=</falsescoremode><falsescore>0.0000000</falsescore><falsepenalty></falsepenalty><falsenextnode>2</falsenextnode><falseanswernote>prt1-2-F</falseanswernote><falsefeedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[]]></text></falsefeedback></node>
